*|DSPF 1.3
*|DESIGN "loadrail"
*|OPERATING_TEMPERATURE 100
*|GROUND_NET 0
* loadrail: an INVENTED example block. A 60 um metal1 VDD rail, fed at x = 0,
* feeds four NMOS current sinks through contacts. Every value is round and
* invented (README.md works the numbers out by hand); no process is described.
* It is an RC DSPF with its devices, so it is also the RCC netlist.
.SUBCKT loadrail VDD VSS G0 G1 G2 G3
*|NET VDD 1.200000e-14
*|P (VDD I *1 0.0000 0.0000)
*|S (VDD:1 5.0000 0.0000)
*|S (VDD:2 10.0000 0.0000)
*|S (VDD:3 15.0000 0.0000)
*|S (VDD:4 20.0000 0.0000)
*|S (VDD:5 25.0000 0.0000)
*|S (VDD:6 30.0000 0.0000)
*|S (VDD:7 35.0000 0.0000)
*|S (VDD:8 40.0000 0.0000)
*|S (VDD:9 45.0000 0.0000)
*|S (VDD:10 50.0000 0.0000)
*|S (VDD:11 55.0000 0.0000)
*|S (VDD:12 60.0000 0.0000)
*|I (XMN0:d XMN0 d I 0 15.0000 0.0000)
*|I (XMN1:d XMN1 d I 0 30.0000 0.0000)
*|I (XMN2:d XMN2 d I 0 45.0000 0.0000)
*|I (XMN3:d XMN3 d I 0 60.0000 0.0000)
Rm1 VDD VDD:1 1.000000 $metal1 $L=5.0000 $W=0.750000 $SI_W=0.7500 $LLX=0.0000 $LLY=-0.3750 $URX=5.0000 $URY=0.3750 $lvl=1
Rm2 VDD:1 VDD:2 1.000000 $metal1 $L=5.0000 $W=0.750000 $SI_W=0.7500 $LLX=5.0000 $LLY=-0.3750 $URX=10.0000 $URY=0.3750 $lvl=1
Rm3 VDD:2 VDD:3 1.000000 $metal1 $L=5.0000 $W=0.750000 $SI_W=0.7500 $LLX=10.0000 $LLY=-0.3750 $URX=15.0000 $URY=0.3750 $lvl=1
Rm4 VDD:3 VDD:4 1.000000 $metal1 $L=5.0000 $W=0.750000 $SI_W=0.7500 $LLX=15.0000 $LLY=-0.3750 $URX=20.0000 $URY=0.3750 $lvl=1
Rm5 VDD:4 VDD:5 1.000000 $metal1 $L=5.0000 $W=0.750000 $SI_W=0.7500 $LLX=20.0000 $LLY=-0.3750 $URX=25.0000 $URY=0.3750 $lvl=1
Rm6 VDD:5 VDD:6 1.000000 $metal1 $L=5.0000 $W=0.750000 $SI_W=0.7500 $LLX=25.0000 $LLY=-0.3750 $URX=30.0000 $URY=0.3750 $lvl=1
Rm7 VDD:6 VDD:7 1.000000 $metal1 $L=5.0000 $W=0.750000 $SI_W=0.7500 $LLX=30.0000 $LLY=-0.3750 $URX=35.0000 $URY=0.3750 $lvl=1
Rm8 VDD:7 VDD:8 1.000000 $metal1 $L=5.0000 $W=0.750000 $SI_W=0.7500 $LLX=35.0000 $LLY=-0.3750 $URX=40.0000 $URY=0.3750 $lvl=1
Rm9 VDD:8 VDD:9 1.000000 $metal1 $L=5.0000 $W=0.750000 $SI_W=0.7500 $LLX=40.0000 $LLY=-0.3750 $URX=45.0000 $URY=0.3750 $lvl=1
Rm10 VDD:9 VDD:10 1.000000 $metal1 $L=5.0000 $W=0.750000 $SI_W=0.7500 $LLX=45.0000 $LLY=-0.3750 $URX=50.0000 $URY=0.3750 $lvl=1
Rm11 VDD:10 VDD:11 1.000000 $metal1 $L=5.0000 $W=0.750000 $SI_W=0.7500 $LLX=50.0000 $LLY=-0.3750 $URX=55.0000 $URY=0.3750 $lvl=1
Rm12 VDD:11 VDD:12 1.000000 $metal1 $L=5.0000 $W=0.750000 $SI_W=0.7500 $LLX=55.0000 $LLY=-0.3750 $URX=60.0000 $URY=0.3750 $lvl=1
Rc0 VDD:3 XMN0:d 12.000000 $cont $A=0.033800 $VC=2 $LLX=14.6250 $LLY=-0.3750 $URX=15.3750 $URY=0.3750 $lvl=0
Rc1 VDD:6 XMN1:d 12.000000 $cont $A=0.033800 $VC=2 $LLX=29.6250 $LLY=-0.3750 $URX=30.3750 $URY=0.3750 $lvl=0
Rc2 VDD:9 XMN2:d 12.000000 $cont $A=0.033800 $VC=2 $LLX=44.6250 $LLY=-0.3750 $URX=45.3750 $URY=0.3750 $lvl=0
Rc3 VDD:12 XMN3:d 24.000000 $cont $A=0.016900 $VC=1 $LLX=59.6250 $LLY=-0.3750 $URX=60.3750 $URY=0.3750 $lvl=0
Cm1 VDD:1 0 1.000000e-15
Cm2 VDD:2 0 1.000000e-15
Cm3 VDD:3 0 1.000000e-15
Cm4 VDD:4 0 1.000000e-15
Cm5 VDD:5 0 1.000000e-15
