Cm8 VDD:8 0 1.000000e-15
Cm9 VDD:9 0 1.000000e-15
Cm10 VDD:10 0 1.000000e-15
Cm11 VDD:11 0 1.000000e-15
Cm12 VDD:12 0 1.000000e-15
* instance section: the devices, on the instance-pin nodes
XMN0 XMN0:d G0 VSS VSS nsink W=80u L=1u
XMN1 XMN1:d G1 VSS VSS nsink W=100u L=1u
XMN2 XMN2:d G2 VSS VSS nsink W=120u L=1u
XMN3 XMN3:d G3 VSS VSS nsink W=100u L=1u
.ENDS loadrail
